  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FUNDA&#xc7;&#xc3;O LUGENDA PROTECTS NIASSA SPECIAL RESERVE. BY IMPROVING THE MEANS OF LIVING FOR 5,000 PEOPLE THERE, THEY REDUCE CONFLICT BETWEEN COMMUNITIES.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project titled Resilience Post Floods, to be implemented by Funda&#xe7;&#xe3;o Lugenda, will be implemented in the Niassa Special Reserve, Block L7, Mecula District, Niassa Province. The current project aims to improve peoples&#x2019; lives through job creation through tourism and knitting, targeting women and young people. Part of the project will be for recovery post-cyclone Freddy. It will reach 5,000 people living in teh Niassa special reserve</narrative>
  </description>
